  "welcome__n": {"text": "I'm Nova, your space guide. Welcome to our solar system! Tap the Sun, or any planet, and I'll tell you all about it."},
  "day_intro__n": {"text": "Why do we have day and night? Because Earth is always spinning, like a top! It turns all the way around once every 24 hours. Find the little home in India, and spin the Earth!", "say": "Why do we have day and night? Because Earth is always spinning, like a top! It turns all the way around once every twenty four hours. Find the little home in India, and spin the Earth!"},
  "quiz_end__n": {"text": "You did it! You finished the whole space quiz. You're a real astronaut now! High five!"},
  "iss_inside__n": {"text": "Welcome aboard! Up here, everything floats, even you! Drag to push yourself around, and tap the floating things to find out about them."},
  "iss_docked__n": {"text": "Docked! Perfect flying! The astronauts can open the hatch and float inside."},
  "ch3_landed__n": {"text": "Soft landing! Well done! On 23 August 2023, Vikram landed near the Moon's south pole. India became the first country ever to land there, and that day is now India's National Space Day!", "say": "Soft landing! Well done! On the twenty third of August, twenty twenty three, Vikram landed near the Moon's south pole. India became the first country ever to land there, and that day is now India's National Space Day!"},
  "v_mercury__n": {"text": "Welcome to Mercury! Look how giant the Sun is! It looks three times bigger than from Earth. Walk around and tap the shiny things to explore.", "say": "Welcome to Mercury! Look how giant the Sun is! It looks three times bigger than from Earth. Walk around and tap the shiny things to explore."},
  "v_moon__n": {"text": "Welcome to the Moon! You are so light here, try jumping! And look, your footprints stay behind, because there's no wind to blow them away.", "say": "Welcome to the Moon! You are so light here, try jumping! And look, your footprints stay behind, because there's no wind to blow them away."},
  "e_inside__n": {"text": "What's inside the Earth? Earth is like a peach: a thin skin, a thick juicy middle, and a hard stone at the centre. Hold the Dig deeper button, and your drill will dig all the way to the centre!"},
  "hi_ayansh": {"text": "Hi Ayansh!"},
